WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.970
It looks like you finally figured it out, Astral.

00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:07.310
Sure I don't know where the Numeron Code's resting place is.

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:14.110
So I made the Earth a part of the Barian World,

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.910
to gain the power of the Numeron Code.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.660
Once I defeat you worms in this Duel,

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.800
I'll obtain the entire Numeron Code.

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:29.620
And then the Past and Future will be mine.

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:32.330
As if I'll let you do something that!

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:36.680
Don Thousand, we're definitely gonna beat you!

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.670
<i>Yuma... Shark... Astral...!</i>

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.860
<i>Please... our future... please protect our future!</i>

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:47.350
I set one card and end my turn!

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:49.130
How foolish...

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:53.660
You're completely powerless before me,
who has the power of the Numeron Code.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:58.970
<i>Sure, stretching out all around us is the Field Spell Card, "Numeron Network".</i>

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:04.200
<i>With its power, this whole Duel can be rewritten.</i>

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.080
<i>If something isn't done about it, our chances of Victory are...</i>

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:14.300
My turn. Draw!

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:20.670
I activate the Spell Card "Numeron Direct"!

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:30.800
This card allows me, while "Numeron Network" is activated,

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:36.620
to chose Xyz Monsters with 'Numeron' in their name and 1000 or less ATK from my Extra Deck,

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:38.570
and special summon 4 of them!

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:42.440
I'll be Summoning 4 Numbers.

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:44.460
Sa- say what, Numbers?!

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:50.040
And these 4 Numbers are the ones that first fell to Earth.

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:57.510
Ever watching over all these grounds, the Guardians of Earth!

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:00.340
Appear, Number 4!

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:05.820
Gate of Numeron - Catvari!

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:10.110
That's the real Number 4!

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:15.260
Come forth now! Number 3! And Number 2!

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:19.150
Gate of Numeron - Trini!

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:22.930
Gate of Numeron - Dve!

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:27.330
And this is the ultimate perfection of "Numeron".

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:29.800
Come forth, Number 1!

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:38.680
When the Iron Gate from where Heaven and Hell are touching opens,

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:40.750
abandon your last Hope!

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.880
Gate of Numeron - Ekam!

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:48.480
Tha- that's Number 1!

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:57.440
Th- the Numbers have combined!?

00:02:57.930 --> 00:03:02.040
These cards are the Numbers appropriate for a God to use.

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:03.660
The Gate of Numeron.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:07.110
But their Attack is only 1000!

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.670
Yuma! You'll beat him!

00:03:10.310 --> 00:03:12.000
That's easy for you to say!

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:16.290
All we've got on our field is the Zero Attack Ganbara Knight!

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:19.200
Additionally, his effect's been negated.

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:22.730
Also, there's something about those Numbers!

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:26.240
Yuma, as long as there is a card on the other field,

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:31.200
he can't rewrite our cards with Numeron Network.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.280
That's right!

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:37.150
I'll have Number 1: Numeron - Ekam, attack Ganbara Knight!

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:41.750
Trap activate! "Half Unbreak"!

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:46.200
During this turn, the attacked monster is protected from destruction by battle

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:49.110
and all damage we take is halved!

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:55.950
And now, the damage pours down upon the Astral World!

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:02.310
The Astral World is...

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:03.430
{marker}

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:07.610
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:12.850
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:24.540
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:28.720
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:35.540
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:39.520
the feelings I want to express.

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:48.540
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:51.790
Right now, with you

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:55.720
Oh - By facing each other,

00:04:56.050 --> 00:05:02.800
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:07.900
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:13.330
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:18.500
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:28.080
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:42.530
<i>"Cut Open a Path to the Future
 Astral's Determination!!"</i>

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.480
It seems to have begun.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:45.780
The battle to decide the future of the Astral and Barian Worlds.

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:48.820
How's that, Astral,

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:53.200
to watch how you yourselves are destroying the Astral World!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.330
That's dirty, Don Thousand!

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:57.580
Cool down.

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:01.500
Right now, we have to endure his attacks by all means!

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:04.460
Endure them? How foolish!

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:08.260
I activate the effect of Number 1: Numeron Ekam!

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.510
After a battle, by using 1 Overlay Unit,

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.220
it doubles the Attack of my Numeron monsters.

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:18.640
But your monsters have no Overlay Units!

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.610
While I control "Numeron Network",

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:28.400
Numeron Monsters don't have to use Overlay Units to activate their effects.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:30.490
Wha- What?!

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:34.080
Again the light in the Network is...

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:36.540
I see!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:39.870
With this effect, all of my monsters

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.210
have their Attack doubled!

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:48.930
And, my other Numbers share the same effect.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:53.300
So each time he battles, his monsters double their Attack!

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.180
How the hell can we...?!

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:56.930
Yuma.

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:02.560
In order to win, we have no choice but to destroy the Numeron Network.

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.360
But how can we...?!

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.570
We don't even know, where that card is...

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:10.990
When the effects of "Numeron Network" are activated,

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:15.410
lights run along the Network stretching out over this world.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.410
Probably...

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:20.210
...they're drawing their power from the Numeron Code,

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:22.080
from where it sleeps inside the Earth.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:27.380
Which means that there is, where the actual card "Numeron Network" has to be.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:32.300
It's up to you two, Yuma, Shark!

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:33.970
Astral...

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.720
Don Thousand.

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:40.770
Astral!

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:46.980
It's up to you two, Yuma, Shark!

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.480
Astral...

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:49.820
How foolish.

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:54.950
Even if you go after the Numeron Network itself to destroy it,

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:58.740
finding it won't change anything about your defeat.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:03.710
Now, behold the true form of "Gate of Numeron"!

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:10.460
Number 2: Gate of Numeron - Dve, Attack Ganbara Knight!

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:20.680
Tha... that's Gate of Numeron's real form!?

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:22.690
It's coming, Yuma!

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:27.690
Got it! I activate Half Unbreak once again!

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:47.170
And now, I activate Number 2 Numeron Dve's effect!

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.670
Their Attack is doubled.

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:52.300
Here it comes again.

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:55.090
Until Astral finds the Numeron Network,

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:57.140
we have to survive by any means!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.180
Yuma!

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.060
Shark!

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.720
And now, Number 3.

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:04.480
Numeron Trini, attack Ganbara Knight!

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:06.900
Half Unbreak, activate!

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.740
Yuma! Shark!

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:25.410
I activate Number 3 Numeron Trini's effect!

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.340
The Attack of all Numeron monsters is doubled.

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:35.510
That's 8000 Attack...

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:38.090
There's no way we can evade this one!

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:41.220
With this, it's over.

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:44.560
Disappear, Yuma. Nasch.

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:50.360
I'll have Number 4: Numeron Catvari attack Ganbara Knight!

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:52.730
As if I let you!

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:56.400
At this moment, I activate the effect of the "Cut In Shark" in my hand!

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:00.990
When a monster is attacked, that monster is tributed,

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:04.950
and then "Cut In Shark" is Special Summoned from my hand in Defense Position!

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.210
Nice save, Shark!

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:22.050
Hold on, Yuma! Shark!

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:26.060
So you want to prolong your end a bit?

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:31.480
I activate the effect of "Number 4: Numeron Catvari"!

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:34.070
The Attack doubles.

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:37.990
16000 Attack?!

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:42.160
That's not all. Since "Numeron Network" is active,

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:47.710
I can chaosify and Rank-Up my "Number 1: Numeron Ekam".

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:49.000
What?!

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:52.290
I Overlay "Numeron Ekam".

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.800
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:59.130
Come forth, Chaos Number 1!

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:04.890
What... What will appear this time?

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:10.100
Destroy the Order of everything and let the Chaos become Darkness!

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:13.900
Guide the World to it's True Form!

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:17.110
Gate of Chaos Numeron Shunya!

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:18.860
However,

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:23.570
if there is no activated "Numeron Network", this monster is destroyed.

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:27.620
And now I activate the effect of "Chaos Numeron Shunya"!

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.080
When this Monster is summoned,

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:32.790
all monsters on the field are banished.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.880
Also, in my next turn,

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:40.470
Number 1: Chaos Numeron Shunya returns to the field.

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:43.760
At that time,

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:48.270
the combined Attack of the monsters banished by this effect...

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:50.430
is inflicted to the opponent as damage.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:52.190
Wha- say what?!

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:58.360
The combined Attack of the monsters banished by Shunya's effect is... <i>50,000</i>!<i></i>

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:01.860
If that guy gets his next turn, then for sure...

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:04.530
... we're going to lose!

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:09.620
My turn, draw!

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:12.120
I Normal Summon "Bomb Shark"!

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:16.460
After this guy battles, he's destroyed,

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:20.460
and the total of all Attack on the field is inflicted to the opponent as damage!

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:24.260
Now, I activate the Spell Card "Aqua Jet"!

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:29.680
During this turn, one WATER Monster gains Attack!

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:34.350
Yeah! By attacking him directly and using its effect,

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.860
you'll deal 4000 damage to him!

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:37.820
No.

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:38.480
Hu?!{HГ¤?}

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:43.110
I activate the effect of "Numeron Network"!

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:47.410
Once per turn, I can send 1 "Numeron" Card from my Deck to the Graveyard

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.200
to activate the sent card's effect.

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:55.420
I send the Counter Trap Card "Numeron Writing Magic" to my Graveyard

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:57.080
to activate its effect!

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.840
When my opponent activates a Spell Card,

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.760
I can negate that activation and effect,

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:07.970
then search my opponent's Deck for a Spell Card that can be activated properly,

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:10.180
and activate it on my opponent's field!

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:14.020
That's the Spell Card "Surface"!

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:19.400
Correct, the card you activated was "Surface" not "Aqua Jet".

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.230
He... He rewrote that card too!

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:26.360
This choses 1 Water Monster in your Graveyard

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:29.490
and Special Summons it in face-up Defense Position.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:33.950
I Special Summon "Cut-In-Shark" from my Graveyard.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:43.510
And since I control other monsters than this card, "Bomb Shark" destroys itself.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:54.020
Something like this...

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:57.390
And Yuma and the others keep on fighting on the field...

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:02.520
Dang it, as long as "Numeron Network" is there,

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:05.240
that guy is free to do with our cards...

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:06.400
Don't give up!

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:08.990
That Duel isn't over yet!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:10.870
Shark...

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:15.080
I activate the Quick Spell Card "Surface Rank-Up"!

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:20.210
When a Water Monster is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard, I can activate this card,

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:23.590
and add a "Rank-Up-Magic" Spell Card from my Deck to my hand.

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:26.260
Here I come, Don Thousand!

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:30.090
I activate "Rank-Up-Magic The Seventh One"!

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:34.310
Come forth, Number 101!

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:37.730
Silent Honors Ark Knight!

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:44.730
I Overlay my Rank 4 "Ark Knight"!

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:49.150
I reconstruct the Overlay Network with this single monster!

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:52.030
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:57.000
Show yourself, Chaos Number 101!

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:59.920
Silent Honors Dark Knight!

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:06.460
Numeron Network's effect is a once per turn effect.

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:08.840
You can't rewrite another card this turn!

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:11.970
And now I activate "Dark Knight's" effect!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:15.260
By sending all its Chaos Overlay Units to the Graveyard,

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:18.770
I can Special Summon "Ark Knight" from the Graveyard.

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.560
Awesome, Shark!

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:23.400
If Ark Knight and Dark Knight...

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:25.610
...if both of them attack...!

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:29.450
Nasch, you were aiming for this from the beginning.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:34.030
That's right. I let you use the effect of Numeron Network before,

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:36.740
to set up this situation.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:41.330
You're telling me you wanted me to rewrite your card!?

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:44.960
This is the end, Don Thousand!

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:47.880
Ark Knight, attack directly!

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:54.800
Go, Dark Knight, attack him directly!

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:57.600
That's the decision!

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:02.060
I Special Summon "Numeron Wall" from my hand, in face-up Defense Position!

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:06.570
When I take Battle Damage, I can Special Summon this card from my hand...

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.820
and end the Battle Phase!

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:10.860
What?!

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:15.240
What a pity, Nasch, <i>just</i> a little more and...

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:17.870
Don Thousand!

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.000
This is it!

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:29.630
This is it, I found it.

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:32.930
The actual card of "Numeron Network".

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:35.760
So you found it?

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:43.020
Astral!

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:45.440
Nice, so you got there.

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:50.190
Don Thousand, this is the end for "Numeron Network"!

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.990
You think, you can destroy that card?

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:58.120
I'm going to take it away from here and bring it the Duel field!

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:01.870
I see. But if this card gets destroyed,

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:06.580
the massive amounts of energy accumulated here have nowhere to go,

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:11.260
and the energy that already was spread through the Numeron Network,

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:15.220
will flow back onto the Earth, likely causing its end.

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:17.800
That's...

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:20.350
Our world will be...?

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:22.270
So what will you do?

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:26.600
Sacrifice the Earth to save the Astral World?

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:29.610
On the other hand, if Numeron Network isn't destroyed,

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:33.820
during my next turn, you will take 50,000 damage

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:35.700
and you will disappear, right?

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:37.610
Astral...

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:46.250
<i>Something has to be sacrificed either way...</i>

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.290
<i>So then...</i>

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:53.800
A- Astral?!

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.760
Hey Astral! No way, you...?

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.560
Yuma... Shark...

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.850
I do believe...

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:10.940
... that this card...

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:15.570
... has to be destroyed!

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.030
The card is on his field now...

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:29.830
Astral, you...

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.760
I activate Dark Knight's effect!

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:39.510
This card can turn an opponent's monster into an Chaos Overlay Unit!

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:41.510
Dark Soul Over!

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:48.350
And now I activate the Spell Card "Depth Eruption".

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:51.900
If I control a WATER Xyz Monster,

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:57.320
I can destroy every card on the field!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.410
Shark!

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:11.170
Oh, Numeron Network's...

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.590
That's... But then...!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:19.840
Yuma, can you hear me?

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:21.930
Don't worry.

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:25.930
That energy, I'll take it on me.

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:28.680
Astral?!

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.520
Hey! What're you sayin' there!

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:34.770
But when you take that, you...?

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:38.190
No way you... were up to this from the beginning...!?

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:43.370
Yuma, I entrust all the Numbers to you.

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:46.700
The rest is up to you, Yuma.

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:48.750
Astral...?!

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:53.880
You big jerk, don't screw around like that!

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:56.880
You... If you're going to sacrifice yourself,

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:59.920
I'll never ever forgive you this!

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:02.680
Astral!

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:05.050
Fare well, Yuma...

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:18.280
You... you are...?

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:21.070
Eliphas!?

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:22.280
Astral.

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:24.450
Why are you...?

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:28.410
The Astral World went down the wrong path before,

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:31.910
but then new powers of "Hope" and "The Bonds of Friendship" were born.

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:34.170
Due to you and Yuma.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:36.460
Eliphas... you...

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:41.880
Astral, you must not die just yet.

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:44.630
I entrust the future to you all...

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:47.470
Eliphas!

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:57.940
Tha... that's...

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:01.530
Eliphas, you phony trickster.

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:04.150
Why...? Just why did...?!

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:07.070
Astral...

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:09.700
Eliphas told me...

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.790
... that he entrusted the future to us.

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:16.540
That's why I mustn't cry.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:21.550
We now carry the hopes of countless friends...

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:24.010
Yuma! Shark!

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:27.010
We absolutely have to win this Duel!

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:33.060
Of course! Here we go, Don Thousand!

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:35.520
I activate Dark Knight's effect!

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:38.940
If it's destroyed while it has Chaos Overlay Units...

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:41.190
it revives itself back to my field!

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:49.570
And then we gain Life Points equal to Dark Knight's Attack!

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:57.580
I set 1 card face-down and end my turn.

00:21:58.170 --> 00:21:59.170
Shark...

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:03.170
We will <i>never</i> lose!

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:06.130
Don Thousand!

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:10.260
{marker}

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:11.890
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:16.310
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:18.600
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:22.270
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:24.030 --> 00:22:24.860
Let it go.

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:38.160
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:43.380
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:49.300
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:54.640
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.760 --> 00:22:59.440
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:05.360
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.610 --> 00:23:07.530
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:11.910
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:15.790
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:17.540
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:22.000
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:24.130
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:26.960
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:29.380
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:32.890
Challenge the GAME

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:45.270
Even though the Numeron Network was destroyed, it only provided a moment of rest.

00:23:45.770 --> 00:23:51.200
To decide his self-rightosly called <i>Duel of God</i> for himself, Don Thousand releases an even greater power!

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:53.410
Chaos Numbers 1000, you say?!

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:54.990
You... Kaito, is that you?

00:23:55.030 --> 00:23:56.660
Even after death, you still...?

00:23:56.660 --> 00:23:59.080
Yuma! It's time we shred that bastard!

00:23:59.410 --> 00:24:01.580
Next Time, on Yu-Gi-Oh ZeXaL II!

00:24:01.580 --> 00:24:04.830
"Our Feelings are as One! The Dragon of Creation, Numeron Dragon"

00:24:05.170 --> 00:24:08.670
I won't give up until the very end!
